{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19599","headline":"春台晴望 · 李程","name":"春台晴望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲台送春目，景物丽新晴。\n霭霭烟收翠，忻忻木向荣。\n静看迟日上，闲爱野云平。\n风慢游丝转，天开远水明。\n登高尘虑息，观徼道心清。\n更有迁乔意，翩翩出谷莺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李程","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}